' manystr.bas: 950 global strings, more than the on-chip heap holds (each a 256-byte page): past its reserve they
' are in SDRAM (they stopped at about 800 with "Not enough String memory"), and what must be on-chip still is
' (a file's descriptor); LOCAL strings and temporaries alongside them
Sub L(n)
  Local a$ = "local" + Str$(n)
  If n < 3 Then L n + 1
  If n = 3 Then Print a$; " "; Len(a$ + a$ + a$)
End Sub
